==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Gavel Base (Enemy Base)|Gavel Base]].
*6 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Bearkini]]s spawn, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**8 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

